        "title": "fix(acp): close SQLite ledger handles on shutdown (#100637)",
        "body": "Fixes #100637.\n\n## Summary\n- add an `AcpEventLedger.close()` lifecycle hook, with SQLite-backed ledgers closing the shared state database cache\n- close the ACP event ledger exactly once from `serveAcpGateway` shutdown\n- update SQLite ledger tests to close handles before temp-dir cleanup and add a Windows file-lock regression\n\n## Reproduction / red proof\n- `npx -y node@22.19.0 scripts/test-projects.mjs \"src/acp/event-ledger.test.ts\" -t \"closes the SQLite-backed state database handle through the ledger lifecycle\" --reporter verbose` failed before the fix with `EBUSY: resource busy or locked, unlink ... openclaw.sqlite`\n- `npx -y node@22.19.0 scripts/test-projects.mjs \"src/acp/server.startup.test.ts\" -t \"closes the ACP event ledger when a shutdown signal stops the server\" --reporter verbose` failed before the fix because `eventLedgerClose` was called 0 times\n\n## Verification\n- `npx -y node@22.19.0 scripts/test-projects.mjs \"src/acp/event-ledger.test.ts\" \"src/acp/server.startup.test.ts\" --reporter verbose`\n- `pnpm tsgo:core`\n- `pnpm tsgo:core:test`\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check --threads=1 src/acp/event-ledger.ts src/acp/event-ledger.test.ts src/acp/server.ts src/acp/server.startup.test.ts`\n- LSP diagnostics: no diagnostics on changed TS files\n- `git diff --check upstream/main`\n\n## Not run\n- `pnpm check:changed`: Blacksmith/Testbox is unavailable on this host, and local `changed:lanes` compares against the fork stale `origin/main` instead of current upstream, selecting unrelated all-repo lanes.",
